{"version":1,"content":"<p>2023年港姐季軍、現年25歲的王敏慈憑精緻五官與曼妙身材，參選至今一直備受矚目，更被網民封為「翻版范冰冰」。</p><p>月前從北京中央戲劇學院順利畢業後，她全面投入演藝圈發展，同時不忘頻頻在社交平台分享近況，與粉絲保持緊密互動。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.956149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"5d9d1c1b549169cd91aa8819083c5edfb1c97f2a00c798cbc69bffc72b890a98","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}